# Neiroths

* https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%9D%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B4,_%D0%9C%D0%B0%D0%BA%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B8%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%B0%D0%BD_%D0%95%D0%B2%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B0%D1%84%D1%8C%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%87

Magnus Wilhelm von Nirod, Swedish major, was elevated to the baronial dignity of the Kingdom of Sweden on February 5, 1687, by King Charles XI. In 1710, as a colonel, he signed a capitulation on the surrender of Reval to Russian troops and entered the Russian service. From him descend the Barons of Niroda[1].